          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Approves a Video source the default policy refuses. By default a serialized video loads only from the page's own origin (HTTP(S), or a same-origin blob: URL); anything else, including cross-origin and data: sources, makes deserialization throw. The callback receives the source resolved against the document base URL and returns true to allow it. Documents are untrusted input, so allow only sources you recognise. The check inspects the URL only: a same-origin URL that redirects to another origin is not detected. In a page with an opaque origin (a sandboxed frame or file:) the default refuses every source, relative paths included."
        }
